File Index

/armor.ts
Purpose: Defines armor class multipliers and slot weights for damage mitigation calculations.

/class-kits.ts
Purpose: Defines tactical class attributes and behaviors for game balance and AI.

/modes.ts
Purpose: Defines all game modes' configurations for the simulation system.

/moon-effects.ts
Purpose: Defines moon phase effects on magi spell power with data-driven modifiers.

/race-modifiers.ts
Purpose: Defines racial stat modifiers and traits that adjust class-based character attributes.

/reclass-kits.ts
Purpose: Defines reclass kit overrides for specialized class modifications.

/terrain.ts
Purpose: Defines tactical terrain properties for a 2D battlefield grid.

/unit-costs.ts
Purpose: Defines dynamic unit cost calculation based on resolved stats rather than static prices.
